00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:07.840
Anything's fine.

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:14.180
We are just here to supervise, you hear?

00:17:14.180 --> 00:17:15.270
Okay.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:19.540
Stop, the both of you are going too far!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.580
What if we lose each other?

00:17:22.580 --> 00:17:25.320
Right, sorry.

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.050
If we want to go on as many attractions as we can,

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:29.750
we mustn't waste any time.

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:39.310
That's quite a view.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:40.580
Sure is…

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:43.540
Putting a man and woman in such a confined space...

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.560
What a ride.
Putting a man and woman in such a confined space...

00:17:44.560 --> 00:17:44.670
Putting a man and woman in such a confined space...

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:45.230
It went higher than I expected.

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:47.020
It was nerve-wracking.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:47.960
Really?

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:50.980
I think it's better than a narrow locker.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:53.090
What have you been doing in a locker?!

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.570
The sweets here are delicious.

00:17:57.570 --> 00:17:59.230
They are, aren't they?

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:03.740
Tsuda-kun, your face is covered in cream.

00:18:05.870 --> 00:18:07.730
What am I gonna do with you?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.020
They get along so well.

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:13.740
And why are yours covered in lipstick?

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:22.200
S- Sorry!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:23.710
It's alright.

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:30.510
Whoops, my breasts are so big they cut off the light.

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:32.390
Dejima-san, why are you here?

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:37.040
Well, this is a theme park operated by the Shichijou Group.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:38.670
I'm here to help out.

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.980
Aren't you a cute couple?

00:18:41.980 --> 00:18:43.730
There's a reason for this...

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:46.820
You should refrain from any lewd acts though.

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:49.070
We have surveillance cameras here.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:51.240
We wouldn't do that kind of thing.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.480
Milady and her friends are also watching.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.260
This is some fine equipment you got here.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:00.820
It says if you throw a coin into this fountain,

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.750
your wish will come true.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.120
Well then.

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.320
I hope good luck comes my way.

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.880
Something like that…

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:14.010
Congratulations!

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:17.740
You are the millionth person to throw a coin in.

00:19:19.390 --> 00:19:25.500
The prize is a free voucher for you and your partner to stay at our hotel.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:30.270
No, no, I can't accept this.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.740
But it's our long-awaited giveaway...

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:33.970
Dejected....

00:19:34.590 --> 00:19:36.280
A situation where I can't refuse.

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:40.280
Congratulations!

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:43.440
Sorry, it happened so suddenly.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:45.960
It's okay. We're going home now.

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:50.540
Why don't you go have some fun with Tsuda-kun?

00:19:53.660 --> 00:19:55.050
I'm sorry...

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.600
you have to deal with so many people.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:06.750
What do you mean, I can stay the night?

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:09.310
Come on...

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:14.820
I swear, parents that would allow their daughter to spend the night out need a stern talking to!

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:18.150
We're talking about a boy and girl sleeping in the same room!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:21.410
In that case, we could just avoid sleeping.

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:22.830
That works!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.280
Men and women spending a sleepless night together

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:27.750
is a whole other kind of indecent!

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:31.840
What a room!

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.520
Wow, the bathroom has a glass wall.

00:20:34.520 --> 00:20:36.090
Look at that view!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:38.470
Glass walls are great.

00:20:38.470 --> 00:20:40.690
Feels like peak NTR material.

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:42.020
We need to talk.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:44.060
The Disciplinary Committee chairman is getting angry!

00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:48.560
At Igarashi's request, we will spend a wholesome night here

00:20:48.960 --> 00:20:51.450
and hold an all-night study session.

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:53.820
Didn't think I'd come all this way to study...

00:20:53.820 --> 00:20:57.320
Hagimura, your writing tools are all blue.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:00.600
Blue helps improve concentration.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.560
It's recommended when studying.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:06.290
Let's all wear one of these then.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:09.810
Just making sure here, but this is a proper hotel, right?!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:13.440
There's normal stuff here too.

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:15.150
See? Tea bags.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.470
We put them in right away.

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:22.220
This black tea is delicious.

00:21:22.740 --> 00:21:26.480
I wonder if we could take some tea bags home with us.

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:28.240
They'd make a good gift.

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:30.350
Tsuda-kun, calm down.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:35.100
Taking home an anime-style T-back is virtually impossible!

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.860
What I asked for was perfectly normal though!

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.540
With this, we'll ace our next exams.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:45.120
I suppose so.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:49.950
We have a singing exam in music class after the holidays, don't we?

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.830
You can't really study for that...

00:21:52.830 --> 00:21:55.220
This room has a karaoke setup.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:58.780
<b>They
had a
lot of
fun.
</b>

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.620
Daybreak!

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.080
My throat's killing me.

00:22:07.080 --> 00:22:07.800
Honey.

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:09.250
So sleepy.

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:12.250
Mornin'!

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:13.610
Did you sleep well?

00:22:13.610 --> 00:22:14.750
Didn't sleep at all.

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:16.320
Tsuda-kun's exhausted.

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:19.040
Ah, it wasn't just the two of us.

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:21.280
All the student council members came.

00:22:28.010 --> 00:22:30.940
A lot happened, but it was a fun time.

00:22:33.760 --> 00:22:35.560
I want to go again.

00:22:40.960 --> 00:22:44.450
I mean I want to go to the amusement park again!

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:46.470
Not another date with him!

00:24:44.040 --> 00:24:45.380
Okay!

00:25:03.060 --> 00:25:03.880
Not here.

00:25:06.680 --> 00:25:07.780
Me

00:25:08.680 --> 00:25:09.840
and Tsuda

00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:13.660
have never hung out alone together!

00:25:14.740 --> 00:25:20.420
I only remember that one time when Hagimura and Aria were busy and we went shopping by ourselves.

00:25:20.420 --> 00:25:23.790
But Tsuda's gone with Hata to a cafe, a movie,

00:25:23.790 --> 00:25:25.420
a foot bath even!

00:25:25.420 --> 00:25:28.800
Shopping and eating crepes with Mori-san.

00:25:28.800 --> 00:25:31.550
Going to the amusement park with Igarashi!

00:25:34.550 --> 00:25:36.560
I'm envious.

00:25:39.150 --> 00:25:40.060
Dogs.

00:25:41.430 --> 00:25:44.310
I'll use this to ask Tsuda out...

00:25:44.310 --> 00:25:45.820
on a date!

00:25:45.820 --> 00:25:48.420
Hey, it's the student council president.

00:25:48.420 --> 00:25:49.820
She seems scary.

00:25:50.220 --> 00:25:51.290
What's wrong?

00:25:51.290 --> 00:25:53.150
Oh, Vice President.

00:25:53.150 --> 00:25:55.560
The president is acting weird.

00:25:55.560 --> 00:25:57.090
So what else is new?

00:25:58.080 --> 00:26:00.460
That is weirder than usual though.

00:26:00.460 --> 00:26:05.920
Tsuda, go on a date with me.

00:26:05.920 --> 00:26:07.470
I can say it.

00:26:07.470 --> 00:26:09.160
I will say it!

00:26:09.160 --> 00:26:11.080
Fight on, Amakusa Shino!

00:26:11.080 --> 00:26:12.150
President?

00:26:12.150 --> 00:26:13.090
Yes?!

00:26:21.910 --> 00:26:23.830
What's up with you?

00:26:23.830 --> 00:26:27.570
If it's too embarrassing, just play it off with a dirty joke as usual!

00:26:27.570 --> 00:26:30.470
We're using this cliche?!

00:26:30.770 --> 00:26:33.520
He accepts you for who you are.

00:26:33.520 --> 00:26:35.780
There is nothing to fear.

00:26:36.410 --> 00:26:38.990
That's so corny it's even more embarrassing!

00:26:44.300 --> 00:26:47.110
Aren't those tickets for Dogs?

00:26:47.500 --> 00:26:50.460
Lucky. Who are you going with?

00:26:50.460 --> 00:26:52.300
This is…

00:26:52.920 --> 00:26:54.040
This is…

00:26:55.040 --> 00:26:56.050
This is…

00:26:57.070 --> 00:26:58.140
Tsuda,

00:26:59.270 --> 00:27:01.060
Sorry, I didn't catch that.

00:27:03.560 --> 00:27:07.810
You, Hagimura, Aria, I'm taking all of us.

00:27:12.640 --> 00:27:16.190
Why... are you crying?

00:27:18.380 --> 00:27:19.700
What's wrong?

00:27:20.840 --> 00:27:22.550
Did something happen?

00:27:24.160 --> 00:27:28.590
Crying in silence, that's not like you at all.

00:27:40.260 --> 00:27:41.510
Tsuda.

00:27:43.090 --> 00:27:45.260
There are only two tickets.

00:27:45.260 --> 00:27:47.270
In order to get the remaining two,

00:27:47.270 --> 00:27:48.940
the two of us are going out later!

00:27:50.700 --> 00:27:53.010
That's fine with me, let's go.

00:27:57.910 --> 00:28:00.990
I've been good all day, can I tell a dirty joke now?

00:28:00.990 --> 00:28:02.130
No way.

00:28:02.130 --> 00:28:03.140
No chance.

00:28:03.140 --> 00:28:04.160
So D-Wheels...

00:28:04.670 --> 00:28:05.910
D-Whe…
